  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Celebrate",
   "texto": [
    "**Праздновать** (celebrate) carries the addition in accusative: **Мы празднуем Новый год** (we celebrate the New Year). **В честь** (in honor of) goes with genius: **в честь праздника** (in honor of the party).",
    "**Традиция** (tradition) and **обычай** (custom) are cultured words that are used in texts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "What you do",
   "texto": [
    "To say that something is customary **принято** + infinitive is used: **Принято дарить подарки** (you are used to giving gifts).",
    "**Принято** is a short form: it does not change with the subject."
   ]
